WEBVTT

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:07.810
A broken heart? Onii-san's?

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.320
Instead of a broken heart, I should have said that he got dumped.

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:15.820
Anyway, it's strange that someone like Asagi-chan never had a boyfriend.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.600
It's all because Kojou-kun is so dense.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:24.510
I didn't know what else to do. So I gave him some chocolate in place of Asagi-chan.

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:25.740
Eh?

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:28.230
December?

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:29.970
That's December, right?

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:33.090
Thank goodness.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.590
After we got attacked by terrorists, I haven't been able to reach you.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:38.210
I've been really worried about you.

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:40.360
December? I see.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.390
That is how Dekatos referred to herself.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:48.130
My name is Hektos. The Sixth Kaleid Blood.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:53.230
Akatsuki Nagisa and the Valkyrie Kingdom's Priestess.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.800
Come with me. Akatsuki Kojou is waiting.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:58.290
Kojou-kun?

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.780
And the truth is also waiting for thee.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:38.230
Vatler! Don't mess with me!

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:40.110
What's the meaning of this?

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:42.750
You didn't even inform the one who is involved.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:47.780
Why did you send invitations to every country to witness my duel?

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:53.240
About that. I wonder who is messing with who... Aladar.

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:58.990
I have been looking forward to the day when I kill Akatsuki Kojou.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.130
And now my prey has been stolen from me.

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:06.460
At the very least, I have the right to watch your duel.

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:11.700
I have to say, I am looking forward to a beautiful duel.

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:17.660
In addition, the bets are currently 6 to 4 in your favour.

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:20.800
You're taking bets on our duel?

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.640
Therefore you cannot put up a disgraceful fight.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:28.210
Disgraceful or not is irrelevant.

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:29.720
The duel will be over in an instant.

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:31.840
He is no match for me.

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:33.840
Oh! Is that right?

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:36.520
Princess La Folia Rihavein.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:38.530
Why are you here?

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:42.620
In the future, Kojou will be my mate.

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:44.850
He won't be beaten that easily.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:49.440
Pardon my rudeness, Princess, but I have seen his abilities.

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:52.950
He is not worthy of being called the Fourth Progenitor.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:58.800
Oh, Your Highness, would you make a bet with me?

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.130
No way...

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:03.700
Are you betting on Akatsuki Kojou to win?

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:05.840
That's right.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:08.070
If he is victorious over your highness,

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:11.070
then you have to acknowledge Kojou as a Progenitor

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:14.260
and invite him to join The Garden of Whispers.

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:18.800
Even if you wish for this to happen,

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:21.570
it's not a condition I can easily accept.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.890
I understand that.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:29.890
So if Kojou loses, I am willing to give you an equivalent reward.

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.180
Oh? What are you planning to bet?

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:34.780
My virginity.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:46.860
In the end, we still haven't found an effective countermeasure.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:50.340
Nothing we can do now. The only thing to do now...

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:59.160
What the hell is this?

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:01.870
This is Lord Ardeal's ship, right?

00:05:03.090 --> 00:05:05.110
The Fourth Progenitor-sama, please hurry up!

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:07.510
The guests are all waiting for you.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:08.590
The guests?

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:11.970
You're finally here, Akatsuki Kojou!

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:13.220
Kirasaka?

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:14.440
Sayaka-san.

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:19.050
Hold on a second! You still don't know what you're going to do in the duel?

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:21.910
You met with Prince Ibriss-Bel, right?

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:25.410
Yeah, but I didn't understand a single word he said.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.910
No way!

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:31.570
It's all your fault, the Princess... the Princess's chastity.

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:32.850
Chastity!?

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:35.950
I made a bet with Chairman Aladar

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:38.940
on who's going to win the duel.

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:41.680
So even you came, La Folia.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.680
What did you bet?

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:50.290
Chairman Aladar, he forced me to... wager my virginity!

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:56.690
If you lose, the chairman can do whatever he wants with my body!

00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:58.000
Is that really true?

00:05:58.110 --> 00:06:00.150
Everything is a lie except for the conclusion.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:03.040
The princess herself asked for the bet.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.080
Isn't that a huge problem?

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.770
If the princess gives him her virginity,

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:12.380
that means she is giving him the blood memories as well.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:16.070
In other words, the secrets of the Kingdom of Aldegia

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:19.360
like spirit mediums and imitation holy weapons will all be given away.

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:21.440
It'll be the destruction of the kingdom!

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:25.070
There's no problem if Kojou wins.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:28.590
No, even if you say that... I can't guarantee that I'll beat that guy!

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:30.220
Please win, Kojou.

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:38.500
Don't worry. Valkyria's protection will be with you.

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:43.450
I have to carry the fate of the Aldegyr Kingdom on my shoulders?

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:45.240
Give me a break!

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:50.720
Attracting more and more problems is a talent of yours,

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:51.950
Akatsuki Kojou.

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:53.810
Natsuki-chan.

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:55.400
Glenda.

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:56.960
What's with those clothes?

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:59.980
This girl is the prize for the duel.

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:02.310
She needs to dress for the occasion.

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:03.990
Kojou.

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:06.550
I understand.

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:08.220
I'll think of something.

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:09.480
Don't worry about it.

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:10.870
Da!

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:13.520
We're going to the deck.

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:15.780
The Snake Charmer is waiting for us there.

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:17.070
Yeah.

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:22.430
Don't be confused, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.220
You're not alone.

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:28.850
Da!

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:33.170
What's wrong, Senpai?

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:37.830
Nothing, I never imagined that a day would come when Natsuki-chan is cheering me on.

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:41.150
Even though it's a little late, thank you for taking care of me.

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:44.050
W- What are you saying? So suddenly...

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:46.640
If something happens to me, please take care of Glenda.

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:52.160
And for Nagisa, please tell her that I'm going far away on a trip.

00:07:52.290 --> 00:07:53.060
No!

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:54.460
Himeragi.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:59.620
Glenda-san, Princess La Folia, Yuiri-san, and Hikawa-senpai.

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:02.130
Only Senpai can save them!

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:05.940
Are you really going to abandon me?

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:08.370
You made me your blood servant,

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:10.140
please take responsibility for that!

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:13.470
Senpai, you must be victorious

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:17.390
and return to my side.

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:19.100
Service.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:21.180
Huh?

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:24.680
If I come back safely...

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:28.050
Service me a lot, please.

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:33.980
Gosh. I understand.

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:38.050
You can do whatever you wish.

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:56.400
Whatever happened to make it turn out this way, it doesn't seem to be to your taste.

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:59.020
One of my foolish compatriots did it.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.850
Let me apologize to you.

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:03.040
If you want to apologize,

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:06.180
I would rather you give up on Glenda.

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:07.810
That's impossible.

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:09.510
I thought so.

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:12.780
So, what's the signal to start the duel?

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:17.280
I'm the one who challenged you to a duel. So you can choose.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:21.060
Then, we'll use this coin to decide.

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:47.590
I never said to wait for the coin to fall!

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:51.700
Come, Second Familiar, Cor Tauri Sucinum!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.150
As expected, it's not going to be that easy.

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:14.140
Armor? No, he wrapped his Familiar around his own body!

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:17.440
You used the coin to divert my view.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:20.110
And used your body without magic to launch a surprise attack.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:24.230
Although I only lost my concentration for an instant, this has not happened in a few centuries.

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:26.850
I have to admit that I underestimated you.

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:29.080
Therefore,

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:34.710
I will use my full power to defeat you,

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.220
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.530
Dance, Ghoulah.

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:49.510
Mesarthim Adamas.

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:00.940
Senpai!

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:03.440
What are you doing, Akatski Kojou?

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:05.290
Get a hold of yourself!

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:13.380
Come, Ninth Familiar, Al-Nasl Minium!

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:21.640
That's not going to work.

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:23.460
Minamiya-sensei.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.040
No matter how much magic he uses,

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:28.470
if he just attacks at random,

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:29.790
he won't be able to defeat Aladar.

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:32.020
It's just wasting his Familiar's power.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:52.390
Calm down, Himeragi Yukina.

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:56.610
I understand that seeing your boyfriend get hurt makes you uncomfortable,

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:57.950
but you're worried about nothing.

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:00.160
He's just the target of my observation!

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:02.920
I'm relieved to see that you've calmed down.

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:05.020
Don't make a mistake for the people you care about.

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:07.630
What do you mean?

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:11.630
This duel may have been planned from the start

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:14.590
by someone who knows the personality of Aladar well.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.250
Personality?

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:19.080
No way, Lord Ardeal?

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:21.280
But why would he do this?

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:24.120
The first thing we should consider is:

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:27.450
Even if it's for a dragon, why would someone as important as Aladar

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:32.140
come all the way to Itogami Island to capture a little girl?

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:36.370
I'm afraid that Aladar has some other objective

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:40.390
and the existance of this dragon girl will hinder him from achieving that objective.

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:43.750
The Snake Charmer is aware of this

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:47.300
and let Akatsuki Kojou and Aladar fight each other on purpose.

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:51.930
Damn you!

00:12:57.590 --> 00:12:59.260
Kojou-kun.

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:03.830
What is happening? Why is Kojou-kun fighting?

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:08.030
With a vampire... He's exactly the same as a vampire!

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:12.820
That's because your big brother is the Fourth Progenitor.

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.350
That man's objective

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:21.470
is to use Aladar as a stepping stone for Akatsuki Kojou to awaken as the complete Fourth Progenitor.

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:25.110
It all makes sense if you think along these lines.

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:39.080
You're lying. Kojou-kun is the Fourth Progenitor,

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:42.570
the strongest vampire in the world,

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:43.370
why?

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:46.220
What are you afraid of?

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:50.220
He saved you by destroying Root along with Avrora

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:52.390
and became the Fourth Progenitor.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:55.120
This is my fault.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:58.240
Because of me, Kojou-kun has become a demon.

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:04.710
At this rate, your brother will be devoured by a scary, scary vampire.

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:15.780
No...

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:20.900
Noooooo!

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:21.940
Nagisa-chan.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:27.550
This magic...

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:39.420
What... happened?

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:43.750
Nagisa?

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:46.030
Why are you here?

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.780
Blame me, Kojou.

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:55.680
Blame the me that made thee bear this heavy burden 
 and have given thee such sorrow.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.920
You, it can't be...

00:14:58.030 --> 00:14:59.400
Are you Avrora?

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:04.210
I am but an illusion... that will soon disappear.

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:10.700
Dodekatos. The Twelfth Kaleid Blood, eh?

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:13.890
Thou would not consider this a violation of the rules of the duel?

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:18.750
Since we are each a piece of the Fourth Progenitor.

00:15:19.090 --> 00:15:20.190
Hektos.

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:22.440
I see.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:24.280
Is this Vatler's doing?

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:28.870
Certainly, I wanted a duel with the Fourth Progenitor.

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:32.280
It would be unfair to exclude you from the fight.

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:33.760
Fine!

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:36.820
Then, I will destroy you and your master all at once,

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:38.300
you puppets!

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:44.120
Kojou-kun, give me your hand!

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:45.630
Nagisa, don't!

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:47.170
Please! Avrora-san!

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:49.760
Come, Alrescha Glacies!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:06.150
Avrora.

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:07.190
Nagisa.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:12.870
Nagisa-chan!

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:15.840
Please...

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:18.020
open your eyes.

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:21.990
<i>You are not alone.</i>

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:27.980
I see. That explains it.

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:30.150
I would have realized sooner

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:32.820
if I could have heard all your voices.

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:37.110
Awaken, Acedia!

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:47.420
That's enough, Aladar.

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:50.680
You certainly are a terrifying opponent.

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:53.640
I'm no match for you.

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:58.700
However, that's not the case for the Fourth Progenitor's Familiars.

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:04.210
That's right.

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:07.550
The ones I should ask for advice is inside my own body,

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:11.560
the Familiars who have been fighting for so long,

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:15.090
they have extraordinary combat experience.

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:19.520
That's my, the Fourth Progenitor's, real power.

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:22.230
Surrender,

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:26.840
unless you wish to continue fighting against our fully awakened power?

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:31.740
That's enough, Kojou.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:36.500
The duel is over. You are the victor.

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:47.890
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:51.560
Let us go. There is something we need to confirm.

00:17:55.390 --> 00:17:58.130
Do not interfere! This is not over!

00:17:58.130 --> 00:18:01.070
Sorry to have used you, Aladar.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:04.360
Your assignment is complete.

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:06.530
Assign...ment?

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:10.820
Her time has been used up.

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:16.600
Only the Priestess of Valkyria's power is keeping her soul in this world.

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:19.720
Are you trying to say that Nagisa cannot be saved?

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:24.500
If thou use a human container to house a Familiar, then continued to invoke its power,

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.570
this is the natural result.

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:27.510
You!

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:28.980
Senpai, no!

00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:32.350
Sorry, accompany me for a while.

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:35.970
I sent them both to my own dimension.

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:39.180
It's only temporary, but they'll manage for a while.

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:41.180
I'm sorry, Natsuki-chan.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:45.260
Now then. Can you answer me, Veres Aladar?

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:49.220
Why do you want to capture the dragon child?

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:52.920
The Holy Ground Treaty Organization fears Glenda. What is the reason?

00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:57.970
Let me answer that question.

00:18:58.230 --> 00:18:59.430
Stop it, Vatler!

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:04.800
The purpose of the Holy Ground Treaty Organization is to maintain peace between humans and demons.

00:19:05.260 --> 00:19:08.750
They have determined that the man-made island known as Itogami Island

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:13.700
is a magical weapon of mass destruction, forbidden by the Holy Ground Treaty.

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:17.750
So they made the decision to destroy Itogami Island.

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:22.360
Itogami Island is a magical weapon of mass destruction?

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:23.640
So that's it.

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:27.620
This way they can destroy the island unilaterally.

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:28.750
Natsuki-chan.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:32.510
Hasn't Itogami Meiga shown you already?

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:38.230
If you use Itogami Island as an altar, you can recreate The Cleansing.

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:45.260
For the purpose of creating an emergency Holy Ground Treaty military force, 
a multi-national naval fleet has gathered in the nearby waters.

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:49.490
At the earliest, they'll be able to completely surround Itogami Island tonight

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:52.530
and present an ultimatum to the Japanese government.

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:53.950
No way...

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:55.710
No, wait a minute.

00:19:56.240 --> 00:20:03.420
Aladar, why did you want to dispose of Glenda when they're attacking Itogami Island at the same time?

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:06.320
Because she's the Guardian.

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:07.610
The Guardian?

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:13.270
Yes, she's the Guardian of Cain's Legacy.

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:15.320
An information storage vessel.

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:18.310
Vatler, how do you know all this?

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:20.820
So that's what happened, Snake Charmer!

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:25.020
Akatsuki Kojou, protect Glenda!

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:26.850
This man's objective is The Cleansing!

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:29.850
Snake charmer, you bastard.

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:32.080
You've absorbed the blood memory of Itogami Meiga.

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:35.500
Bingo! Witch of the Void.

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:37.180
Vatler, damn you!

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:40.940
But who is performing the ritual for The Cleansing?

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:44.310
Don't tell me...

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:55.480
Da!

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:56.490
Gah!

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:57.360
Glenda!

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:02.100
Asagi, you?

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:03.520
I'm sorry.

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:08.030
Senpai!

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:50.440
You're finally awake. Kojou.

00:22:51.560 --> 00:22:52.250
Nina.

00:22:52.740 --> 00:22:53.670
Where am I?

00:22:53.840 --> 00:22:55.520
At Natsuki's apartment.

00:22:56.060 --> 00:22:59.720
She brought you here after you lost consciousness in the fight.

00:22:59.960 --> 00:23:00.850
I see.

00:23:01.720 --> 00:23:05.210
Asagi... where did she take Glenda?

00:23:05.300 --> 00:23:07.100
Onto the Snake Charmer's ship.

00:23:07.720 --> 00:23:10.460
You finally woke up, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:13.920
Here's a change of clothes. I borrowed your house key and got them.

00:23:14.110 --> 00:23:15.070
Sorry.

00:23:15.140 --> 00:23:16.530
Thank you, Himeragi.

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:18.840
Is your body alright?

00:23:19.110 --> 00:23:21.250
Yeah, it's not a big deal.

00:23:21.630 --> 00:23:23.920
Geez, what is Asagi thinking?

00:23:24.220 --> 00:23:25.860
Why would she help that Vatler?

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:28.370
Citizens of Itogami Island, good evening.

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:30.500
I'm Aiba Asagi.

00:23:30.740 --> 00:23:32.870
On behalf of the Man-made Island Management Corporation,

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:35.910
I have an important announcement for you.

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:38.380
To start, please watch this video.

00:23:40.160 --> 00:23:41.750
Six hours ago:

00:23:42.140 --> 00:23:44.860
The Holy Ground Treaty Organization sent to the Japanese government

00:23:45.470 --> 00:23:49.750
a communiqué identifying Itogami Island as a magical weapon of mass destruction.

00:23:51.060 --> 00:23:54.850
Accordingly, they have dispatched a multi-national naval strike force.

00:23:55.060 --> 00:23:58.040
12 hours after the communiqué was sent, at six A.M. this morning,

00:23:58.400 --> 00:24:03.840
the Holy Ground Treaty forces will commence their attack on Itogami Island.

00:24:04.450 --> 00:24:06.920
Regretably, as there is little time remaining,

00:24:07.240 --> 00:24:11.430
it is impossible to evacuate all of Itogami Island's 560,000 inhabitants.

00:24:12.080 --> 00:24:19.140
Moreover, there are no cities on the Japanese mainland that can accept Itogami Island's over 20,000 demon inhabitants.

00:24:19.790 --> 00:24:23.060
In the face of The Holy Ground Treaty Organization's oppressive actions,

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.640
I call upon the entire population of Itogami Island to resist!
